#: ../../source/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"clash_tools is a comprehensive collection of utilities for managing Clash"
" proxy configurations and services. It provides multiple command-line "
"tools for different purposes, making it easy to work with Clash in "
"various environments."
msgstr "clash_tools 是一组用于管理 Clash 代理配置与服务的工具集合，提供多种命令行工具，方便在不同环境中使用 Clash。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:22
msgid "Tools Overview"
msgstr "工具概览"

#: ../../source/index.rst:24
msgid "The toolkit includes four main utilities:"
msgstr "该工具包包含四个主要工具："

#: ../../source/index.rst:26
msgid "**wg_docker**"
msgstr "**wg_docker**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:27
msgid "WireGuard docker orchestration for server/client deployments."
msgstr "面向服务端/客户端部署的 WireGuard Docker 编排工具。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"Key highlights: - User config directory: "
"``/var/lib/clash_tools/wireguard/`` (override with ``CLASH_TOOLS_WG_CONFIG_DIR``) - Renders "
"``server_wg0.conf``/``client_wg0.conf`` and docker compose files - "
"Commands: ``server`` (``up``/``down``/``restart``/``show``/``config"
"``/``get-client-config``), ``client`` "
"(``up``/``down``/``restart``/``config``)"
msgstr "要点：- 配置目录：``/var/lib/clash_tools/wireguard/``（可通过 ``CLASH_TOOLS_WG_CONFIG_DIR`` 覆盖）- 渲染 ``server_wg0.conf``/``client_wg0.conf`` 与 docker compose 文件 - 命令：``server``（``up``/``down``/``restart``/``show``/``config``/``get-client-config``）、``client``（``up``/``down``/``restart``/``config``）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:34
msgid "**clash_docker**"
msgstr "**clash_docker**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35
msgid "Docker proxy management tool for enabling/disabling Docker proxy settings"
msgstr "启用/禁用 Docker 代理设置的管理工具"

#: ../../source/index.rst:37
msgid "**clash_proxy**"
msgstr "**clash_proxy**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"Shell script for setting up proxy environment variables in the current "
"session"
msgstr "为当前会话设置代理环境变量的 Shell 脚本"

#: ../../source/index.rst:40
msgid "**clash_serve**"
msgstr "**clash_serve**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:41
msgid ""
"Service management tool for starting the Clash service and managing "
"configuration files"
msgstr "用于启动 Clash 服务并管理配置文件的服务管理工具"

#: ../../source/index.rst:44
msgid "Features"
msgstr "特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:46
msgid ""
"🚀 **Docker Integration**: One-click enable/disable Docker client and "
"daemon proxy"
msgstr "🚀 **Docker 集成**：一键启用/禁用 Docker 客户端与守护进程代理"

#: ../../source/index.rst:47
msgid "🔧 **Environment Setup**: Easy proxy environment variable configuration"
msgstr "🔧 **环境配置**：轻松设置代理环境变量"

#: ../../source/index.rst:48
msgid "🎯 **Service Management**: Simple Clash service startup and management"
msgstr "🎯 **服务管理**：简化 Clash 服务启动与管理"

#: ../../source/index.rst:49
msgid "📊 **Status Monitoring**: Real-time proxy status checking"
msgstr "📊 **状态监控**：实时检查代理状态"

#: ../../source/index.rst:50
msgid "🔄 **Configuration Reset**: Convenient reset functionality"
msgstr "🔄 **配置重置**：便捷的重置功能"

#: ../../source/index.rst:51
msgid "💻 **Multi-platform**: Works on Linux systems with systemd support"
msgstr "💻 **多平台**：适用于支持 systemd 的 Linux 系统"

